{
 "name": "keeper",
 "about": "The Shrine Keeper as a solid shape sprite: a wide weathered straw hat, violet wrappings with burning eyes under the brim, a shawl and a veil down the back, dark lacquered pauldrons with lames and rivets, tapering wrapped bracers and shins, rope cords and charm gourds at the belt, lacquer tassets on a yoke that tilts with the hips over a tattered black skirt that hangs, split at the front over a violet underskirt, wrapped sandalled feet. Drawn around the 120 px author pose (pixelforge shapes template --height 120); the yoke, skirts, veil, cords and gourds hang from their bones (hang) and swing after them (lag). Shapes and rules with 'px' are the size variants: specks, fingers and rivets at 90 px and above, thicker cords and bigger hands below.",
